# Special cases when reading FITS files (with irevx): a 1-D spectrum with
# CRPIX1=3; a 16-bit integer image without wavelength calibration (warning,
# STWV=1, DISP=1); a logarithmic scale (rejected) followed by an HDU given
# with the CFITSIO syntax file.fits[0]; and an error frame read where a data
# frame is expected (warning; the output remains an error frame).
outputs = s_r.fits i16_r.fits hdu_r.fits e_r.fits
--- run irevx
spec.fits
s_r.fits
--- run irevx
img16.fits
i16_r.fits
--- run irevx
imglog.fits
img_a.fits[0]
hdu_r.fits
--- run irevx
img_ae.fits
y
e_r.fits
